Documentation

The text of README.md, README.ja.md, README.zh.md and the Markdown files under
docs/ is additionally available under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International licence (CC BY 4.0). Quote it, translate it, build on it, with
attribution. This covers the text only — screenshots, brand artwork and bundled
fonts are excluded, and the software itself stays under the terms above.

Third-party components

Not everything in this repository belongs to the author, and the terms above do
not reach what does not.

static/fonts/cinzel/ holds the Cinzel typeface, copyright 2020 The Cinzel Project
Authors, licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. Its licence text sits beside
it in static/fonts/cinzel/OFL.txt and governs those files. The font is
redistributed under the OFL and under no other licence.

Python dependencies are declared in requirements.txt and are not distributed here;
each keeps its own licence. ffmpeg is invoked as a separate program and is not
included.

